{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "40077895-7b5c-8b17-b8a3-7e35ab369ff6",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T11:35:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yuki Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:33:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:33:07-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi! Hi, Denise, great, thank you for picking up! This is Yuki Abdi. I'm calling about the storm drain in front of my house. It backed up again and again, honestly, every time it rains hard it fills up the street!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:33:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:33:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "413 Kingston Avenue, up on the Historic Hill. The drain's right at the curb out front. After the nor'easter last weekend, Saturday into Sunday, the water just sat there, and then it came into my cellar!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:33:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It got into your cellar? How much water are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:33:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few inches! Wonderful, right? Up to the hubcaps, if you want to picture it, on the car parked out front. And the cellar, that has never happened in all the years I've lived here. Never! Not once!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:34:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So this is the first time it's gotten inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:34:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "First time, yes! But that drain has been clogged for a while. I'm not the first one to notice, I'm sure of it. Nobody has come to clear it, and now I'm hauling wet boxes out of the cellar! Great way to start a Monday!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:34:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Is the drain still holding water now, or has it gone down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:34:28-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's gone down some, but it's full of leaves and slush and junk. Sorry, hold on, [pause] there's a truck going by. Okay. And the whole block smells like fresh bread, because somebody a few doors down is baking, so at least that part is nice! But the drain, no!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:34:47-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's something. All right, I'll put in a work order for a crew to look at the drain in front of 413 Kingston and clear it. They're busy after a storm like that, but it's flagged as a flooding complaint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:35:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, wonderful, thank you! But can somebody call me back when it's done? I want to know it's actually done, because I can't go through this again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:35:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:35:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:35:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0195. I'll note that they should call you once the work is finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:35:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect! Thank you so much, Denise. Please tell them it's urgent, there's water in my cellar!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:35:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in the notes. Take care, Yuki."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:35:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too! Bye!"
    }
  ],
